<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka appoints new Airlanka chairman - paper.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka appoints new Airlanka chairman - paper.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka has appointed a new chairman for soon-to-be-privatised national carrier Airlanka Ltd, the government-run Daily News said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It quoted an official statement as saying D.H.S. Jayawardena had been appointed to head a reconstructed board of directors.</p>
<p>Government officials were not immediately available for comment on the report.</p>
<p>Airlanka is being restructured with the government selling a 40 percent stake and management, under a public enterprise reform programme.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
